📘 School ERP (SchoolHub – Centralized School Management System)
Objective

A centralized ERP system that integrates academic, administrative, financial, inventory, library, hostel, transport, teacher, student, and parent activities into one platform.

🔑 Core Modules
1. Student Management

Registration & Admission (with digital documents).

Student Profiles (personal, guardian, medical, transport, category-based).

Attendance (daily, subject-wise, biometric/manual).

ID Card Generator (QR/barcode supported).

Student performance tracking (attendance + marks overview).

2. Staff Management

Teacher/Staff Registration with role-based access.

Profiles (qualifications, subjects taught, roles, salary structure).

Attendance (linked to payroll).

Class Timetables (auto/manual creation, conflict detection).

Performance evaluation (manual feedback + workload analysis).

3. Administrative & Accounting Management

Fee Management: Admission, monthly, transport, exam, hostel, miscellaneous.

Payment Modes: Cash, bank deposit, QR/e-wallet, online payments.

Billing & Dues: Auto-reminders via SMS/app/email.

Transparent Expenses Entry with receipts.

Financial Reports: Profit/loss, cash flow, income vs. expenses.

Capital/Grants (अनुदान = grant/subsidy), donations, investments.

Payroll System: Salary, overtime, allowances, deductions, PF, tax.

4. Academic Management

Academic Year Setup (sessions, terms).

Course & Syllabus Management (credit hours, subjects).

Exam Management (schedules, admit cards, seating arrangement).

Result Management (marks entry, grading, transcripts).

Grading Systems (customizable: GPA, percentage, letter).

Report Cards (digital + printable).

Notices & Circulars (exam, events, announcements).

5. Inventory Management

Fixed Assets: Buildings, classrooms, labs, furniture, equipment.

Current Assets: Stationery, lab chemicals, sports equipment.

Maintenance Logs & depreciation tracking.

Stock alerts for low inventory.

6. Library & Hostel Management

Library

Book Catalog (ISBN, author, publisher).

Allocation, Return, & Due Date reminders.

Fines for late returns.

Book sales & donations.

Hostel

Room Allocation (single/shared).

Hostel Attendance.

Mess Menu & Schedule.

Hostel fee billing & dues.

7. Teacher Module

Assignment Uploads & Homework tracking.

Homework Verification (completed/not completed).

Marks & Grading entry (class tests, assignments, exams).

Lesson Planning & Class Diary (topics taught daily).

Behavior/Remarks system for students.

Communication with parents (messages, notices).

8. Parent Portal

Dashboard with attendance, results, homework, assignments, and fees.

Homework Monitoring (completion status visible).

Fee Payment (online, QR code, or bank reference).

Notifications for exams, PTM, results, dues, and events.

Feedback & grievance system (message to school/teachers).

9. Super Admin Dashboard

System Configuration (grading rules, academic sessions, fee structure).

Section Admin Creation (finance, academics, inventory).

Full Monitoring (financial, academic, inventory, reports).

Approval/Override permissions for any module.

Annual & Monthly Reports (finance, academics, staff, inventory).

Audit Logs (who changed/approved what).

10. Section Admins

Administrative Admin: Fees, expenses, billing, payroll, financial reports.

Academic Admin: Students, staff, syllabus, timetables, exams, results.

Inventory Admin: Assets, stock, library, hostel, repairs, and maintenance.

📲 Additional Features (No AI, Only Useful Tools)

Mobile App (Android/iOS): Students, teachers, and parents access on-the-go.

SMS/Email/Push Notifications: Fees, results, attendance, urgent notices.

Transport Management: Bus routes, fare calculation, driver details, student allocation.

E-Learning Support: Teachers upload PDFs, notes, lecture videos (optional).

Online Exam & Quiz: MCQs or subjective with manual checking.

Multi-School/Branch Support: Useful for school groups.

Role-Based Access Control: Each role sees only what’s relevant.

Backup & Security: Daily auto-backups, encryption, role-based authentication.

Custom Reports: Section admins & super admin can generate reports in chosen format (Excel/PDF).

Audit Trail: For accountability and transparency in every action.

📊 Architecture & Data Flow

Super Admin → Full authority; can approve, reject, or configure system-wide settings.

Section Admins → Handle specialized modules (finance, academics, inventory).

Teachers → Manage classes, assignments, results, homework.

Students → Receive results, timetable, homework, attendance info.

Parents → Monitor students, pay fees, get notifications.

Data flows upward (teacher → section admin → super admin) for validation, and downward (super admin → section admins → teachers/students/parents) for instructions & announcements.

✅ This gives you a professional, complete, realistic ERP system design for schools — no AI involved, just strong automation and proper digital workflows.